offline_data/
# .claude/ was ignored wholesale until 2026-07-28. That also hid skills/ and
# agents/, which are machine-independent project tooling -- and CLAUDE.md points
# at `.claude/skills/rl-v2-commands/SKILL.md` as the CLI reference, so a fresh
# clone got a CLAUDE.md citing a file the clone did not contain. Only the two
# machine-local settings files stay out.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
docs/offline_mbrl_plan

